      "category": "Quantitative Aptitude",
      "question": "[Sample] A shopkeeper marks his goods 30% above the cost price and allows a discount of 10%. What is his net profit percentage?",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] एक दुकानदार अपने माल को क्रय मूल्य से 30% अधिक अंकित करता है और 10% की छूट देता है। उसका शुद्ध लाभ प्रतिशत क्या है?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "15%"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "17%"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "20%"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "18%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "explanation": "Profit % = 30 − 10 − (30 × 10)/100 = 17%.",
      "exam": {
        "name": "SSC CGL",
        "year": 2024,
        "shift": "Shift 1"
      },
      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "source": {
