      "category": "Quantitative Aptitude",
      "question": "[Sample] By selling 36 oranges, a vendor loses the selling price of 4 oranges. His loss percentage is:",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] 36 संतरे बेचने पर एक विक्रेता को 4 संतरों के विक्रय मूल्य के बराबर हानि होती है। उसका हानि प्रतिशत है:",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "10%"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "11 1/9%"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "9%"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "12.5%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "explanation": "Loss = 4 SP, SP = 36 => CP = 36 + 4 = 40. Loss % = (4/40) × 100 = 10%.",
      "exam": {
        "name": "SSC CHSL",
        "year": 2023,
        "shift": "Shift 2"
      },
      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "source": {
