      "question": "[Sample] Successive discounts of 20% and 15% are equivalent to a single discount of:",
      "questionHindi": "[नमूना] 20% और 15% की क्रमिक छूट किस एकल छूट के बराबर है?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "32%"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "33%"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "35%"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "30%"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "explanation": "Equivalent discount = 20 + 15 − (20 × 15)/100 = 35 − 3 = 32%.",
